        <item>
            <title>1.1.0</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <ul>
                    <li>New: Audio Output Switcher — switch speakers/Bluetooth/monitor output right from the dropdown</li>
                    <li>New: Kill Process on Port — type a port, kill whatever's listening on it, no Terminal needed</li>
                    <li>New: Text Grab (OCR) — copy text straight out of a screenshot region</li>
                    <li>Now Playing: click or right-click the Music/Spotify icons when nothing's playing to open them, shuffle, play favorites, playlists, or genres</li>
                    <li>File Shelf: added an AirDrop button per item, and automatic PNG→JPEG compression on drop when it's actually smaller</li>
                    <li>Clipboard History: raised the cap to 200 entries, added search and pinning</li>
                    <li>Global keyboard shortcuts extended to cover this release's new features</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
